1
00:01:49,959 --> 00:01:51,159
Back so soon?

2
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,000
You didn't actually go to the Plato Hotel

3
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,000
just to look around, did you?

4
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,400
Didn't you already know?

5
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,120
Dan... President Dan.

6
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:30,960
Anda.

7
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:32,680
Tell Xiao Chuan

8
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:35,400
we're having a meeting at the hotel at 10:00 a.m. sharp.

9
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:37,840
All right, I'll let him know right away.

10
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:48,080
For headquarters to establish Plato Hotel here

11
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,319
was actually a risky investment.

12
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,039
Although over the past year

13
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,639
we've hosted dignitaries,

14
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,400
celebrities, and major events,

15
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,639
and our occupancy rate

16
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:58,280
has reached 70 percent,

17
00:02:58,879 --> 00:03:01,159
with the expansion of China-Africa trade,

18
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,000
the clientele we'll soon be serving

19
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,639
will come from all walks of life.

20
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:08,360
Antilocaris has developed rapidly in recent years.

21
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:11,280
Soon, many companies and individuals

22
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,800
will come here to expand their markets.

23
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,360
Our hotel,

24
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,680
as the first four-star hotel here,

25
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,439
will face many

26
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:19,960
formidable competitors.

27
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:21,319
So I expect all of you,

28
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,960
no matter what you do,

29
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:25,840
to hold yourselves to five-star standards.

30
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:29,439
Xiao Chuan,

31
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:32,759
don't let rigid mindsets

32
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:35,280
limit our thinking, okay?

33
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,199
President Dan, you're right.

34
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:41,120
We... We must, um...

35
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:43,759
broaden our minds and think outside the box.

36
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:51,319
Mr. Xiao, about President Dan's surprise visit...

37
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,639
We were totally caught off guard.

38
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,719
Isn't that a massive slip-up?

39
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:57,000
I'm worried she'll keep the two of us stuck here.

40
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,840
No way.

41
00:03:59,039 --> 00:04:00,439
You're overthinking it.

42
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:01,759
How could that happen?

43
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,319
President Dan is here this time,

44
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,000
and she's staying for a week.

45
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:09,879
Everyone needs to step it up

46
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:10,800
and work harder.

47
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,159
I believe

48
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:14,960
we can definitely turn things around.

49
00:04:15,199 --> 00:04:16,560
Honestly, I doubt it.

50
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,480
She was talking about attitude today.

51
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,879
Look at her attitude.

52
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,279
It's like she can't wait

53
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,879
to leave the two of us in Africa forever.

54
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,800
What the hell do you know?

55
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:30,000
As they say, a new broom sweeps clean.

56
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,399
If she doesn't chew us out,

57
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:34,079
how can she show how sharp she is?

58
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:35,399
If she doesn't criticize us,

59
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:37,079
how can she prove how brilliant she is?

60
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:40,199
So, the happier she is chewing us out,

61
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,279
the safer we are.

62
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:42,920
Mr. Xiao,

63
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:43,959
I heard a group of

64
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:45,560
VIP guests will be checking in soon.

65
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:49,240
Don't you think we should make a move?

66
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,639
Make what move?

67
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,879
Anda handles reception,

68
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,480
and Xiang Lai handles security.

69
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,360
The two of us just stay behind the scenes

70
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:58,959
and supervise them.

71
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:01,639
You're always thinking ahead, Mr. Xiao.

72
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:03,480
You really see the big picture.

73
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,959
I can't hold a candle to you.

74
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:08,480
Right, I'll go get bug repellent.

75
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:09,759
Bug repellent?

76
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,759
President Dan is terrified of bugs.

77
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,560
Turns out the she-devil has a weakness too.

78
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:17,360
Still, she's really ruthless.

79
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,279
Pulling a surprise inspection like this...

80
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:20,120
It's really not something

81
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,240
just anyone could pull off.

82
00:05:22,439 --> 00:05:23,759
Yes, you.

83
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:27,480
Handsome, tall, and well-built.

84
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:28,680
Right?

85
00:05:29,839 --> 00:05:30,720
Get straight to the point.

86
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,680
You win over President Dan.

87
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:37,759
Win her over how?

88
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,720
Just stay right by her side

89
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,240
as her personal bodyguard.

90
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:44,040
That'll show how important she is

91
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,120
and keep her happy.

92
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:46,839
That's a great idea.

93
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:50,000
Why me?

94
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,600
If you keep her satisfied,

95
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,959
she'll have a good impression

96
00:05:54,959 --> 00:05:56,519
of your Zhong'an Group.

97
00:05:56,519 --> 00:05:58,920
Wouldn't that benefit your company?

98
00:05:58,920 --> 00:05:59,639
Right?

99
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,560
I'll give it a shot.

100
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,839
How come this Mr. Xiang

101
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:11,560
is so handsome?

102
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:25,560
What are you doing here?

103
00:06:26,279 --> 00:06:27,120
Hello, President Dan.

104
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,879
Here's your security plan.

105
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,279
Starting today,

106
00:06:30,399 --> 00:06:31,720
I'm your security officer.

107
00:06:31,759 --> 00:06:32,759
Please feel free to evaluate

108
00:06:32,759 --> 00:06:33,639
my professional competence.

109
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,519
You?

110
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:36,480
You can't even catch a petty thief.

111
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:44,879
Antilocaris

112
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:46,199
is a very dangerous place.

113
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:47,240
I advise you to keep the curtains closed

114
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,399
twenty-four hours a day.

115
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:52,040
Are you crazy? What's so dangerous?

116
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,439
President Dan, please consider this:

117
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,360
Antilocaris

118
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:00,160
is a place where anyone can carry a gun.

119
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:01,120
Trust me,

120
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,160
if people here can solve a problem with a gun,

121
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:04,519
they won't call the police.

122
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:09,639
President Dan,

123
00:07:10,079 --> 00:07:11,959
under section two of the security plan,

124
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:14,519
I'll conduct a security check of your room.

125
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:25,199
Why are you barging into my room?

126
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:30,399
President Dan, the security check is complete.

127
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,120
The security level...

128
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:33,920
is decent.

129
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,839
Since you're already here,

130
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,360
why not help me clean up?

131
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:46,480
President Dan, I'm only here for your safety.

132
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,120
Fine, then.

133
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:50,199
Go get me a kettle from the front desk.

134
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:54,759
President Dan, I'm not your nanny.

135
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,920
If you won't even help with a small thing like this,

136
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,639
what do I need you for?

137
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:16,319
Anda, come here a second.

138
00:08:17,279 --> 00:08:18,240
Okay, I'll be right there.

139
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,560
The GPS tracker

140
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,199
is already inside this watch.

141
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:23,680
You just have to wear it.

142
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,360
I'll go.

143
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:49,679
President Dan, did you want to see me?

144
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,679
Why isn't there a kettle in the room?

145
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,480
Because you don't like drinking hot water.

146
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,759
You didn't provide one since I dislike it?

147
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,759
Room service has standards.

148
00:08:58,919 --> 00:09:00,879
Do you get to decide what guests like?

149
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,360
What if your assumption is wrong?

150
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:05,679
I... I didn't think of that.

151
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:08,080
You must pay attention to these details.

152
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:10,639
Your oversight reflects poorly on the hotel.

153
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,919
Understood. I'll get one right away.

154
00:09:14,919 --> 00:09:15,639
Wait.

155
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:18,919
Take this so-called bodyguard of yours...

156
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:19,799
...and get him out of my sight.

157
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,080
I honestly can't tell...

158
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:23,720
...if he's here to protect me...

159
00:09:24,039 --> 00:09:25,639
...or scare me.

160
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,759
You misunderstood.

161
00:09:28,759 --> 00:09:30,720
Xiang Lai wasn't trying to scare you.

162
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:32,320
You know how unsafe...

163
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,919
...a place like Antilocaris is.

164
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,960
The dorms were even bombed when I arrived.

165
00:09:36,759 --> 00:09:38,879
Out of concern for your safety...

166
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:39,759
...we assigned a...

167
00:09:39,759 --> 00:09:41,480
...personal bodyguard to protect you.

168
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,679
You're our VIP guest for this stay...

169
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:47,919
...so you can experience firsthand...

170
00:09:47,919 --> 00:09:50,840
...the security service we provide.

171
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,440
Weren't you worried about security?

172
00:09:53,559 --> 00:09:55,360
If there's anything you're unsatisfied with...

173
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,399
...you can let me know.

174
00:09:56,399 --> 00:09:58,399
That way, I can give them feedback early...

175
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,360
...and make adjustments.

176
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,879
This will ensure you and other guests...

177
00:10:00,879 --> 00:10:01,679
...are more satisfied.

178
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:11,399
D-Don't make her mad.

179
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:15,919
I'll go get the kettle.

180
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,200
What did you do to scare her like that?

181
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,360
I just did what you told me to!

182
00:10:26,759 --> 00:10:28,519
Wait, don't talk nonsense!

183
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:42,320
Xiang Lai.

184
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:43,919
The scenery around here...

185
00:10:43,919 --> 00:10:45,399
...is actually pretty nice.

186
00:10:47,559 --> 00:10:48,919
Anything fun to do nearby?

187
00:10:48,919 --> 00:10:50,120
I'm planning to go out for a walk.

188
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,639
It's not very safe outside.

189
00:10:54,799 --> 00:10:56,039
You can't go out alone.

190
00:10:56,279 --> 00:10:57,440
Even if you do go out—

191
00:10:57,679 --> 00:10:59,919
Why is nowhere ever safe?

192
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:01,440
What do I even have you for?

193
00:11:01,799 --> 00:11:03,639
As your client, I'm telling you,

194
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,720
I demand to go out right now.

195
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:09,080
President Dan, according to the security plan—

196
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,360
I'm going myself!

197
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:31,240
A motorcycle is nice,

198
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,320
but riding a motorcycle at your age...

199
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,519
Watch out for arthritis.

200
00:11:35,039 --> 00:11:37,360
Thanks. I'll take good care of myself.

201
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:39,039
Can you ride a motorcycle?

202
00:11:42,519 --> 00:11:44,000
It looks so cool.

203
00:11:44,399 --> 00:11:45,440
Can I give it a try?

204
00:11:47,279 --> 00:11:48,080
Anda.

205
00:11:48,679 --> 00:11:49,480
Let's go.

206
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,039
Anda.

207
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:54,399
You still have five minutes before your shift ends.

208
00:11:54,679 --> 00:11:55,759
Leaving early?

209
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,440
I told her you'd be wandering around,

210
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,399
so she followed you to make sure you were safe.

211
00:12:01,519 --> 00:12:04,279
Fine, then I want to ride the motorcycle.

212
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,639
C-Cars are safer.

213
00:12:19,639 --> 00:12:20,039
Let's go

214
00:13:14,799 --> 00:13:16,200
Wei Tian is so unreliable.

215
00:13:16,399 --> 00:13:17,799
He said he'd follow us with Anda,

216
00:13:17,799 --> 00:13:19,159
so why did he run off with her?

217
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,519
Ditching that little burden is fine too.

218
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,120
What, are you jealous?

219
00:13:23,279 --> 00:13:25,519
No, I'm just worried they'll be in danger.

220
00:13:25,919 --> 00:13:28,000
Danger? What danger could there be?

221
00:13:28,039 --> 00:13:29,320
Just focus on driving.

222
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,960
Do you think leaving Xiang Lai alone with President Dan

223
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,519
could be dangerous?

224
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,960
Why? Don't you trust Zhong'an?

225
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:16,080
No, it's just that President Dan is hard to get along with.

226
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:17,840
Don't worry.

227
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,440
Difficult people...

228
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,279
sometimes when they meet certain people,

229
00:14:21,279 --> 00:14:23,600
they might actually get along better.

230
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,080
That's true.

231
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,320
As it stands,

232
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:31,440
President Dan seems nicer to Xiang Lai than to me.

233
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:36,799
Maybe Xiang Lai will put in a good word,

234
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:40,200
and President Dan will give you some time off

235
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,320
so you can return home.

236
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:42,799
Sounds nice.

237
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,120
Pretty good, right?

238
00:14:47,159 --> 00:14:49,960
This world is just so vast.

239
00:14:52,639 --> 00:14:53,759
Setting out across the sea,

240
00:14:53,759 --> 00:14:55,440
you can reach anywhere.

241
00:14:56,399 --> 00:14:58,480
Every path should lead home, right?

242
00:14:59,559 --> 00:15:00,360
Homesick?

243
00:15:01,639 --> 00:15:05,360
Yeah, but I don't dare think about it.

244
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:09,759
Fearing that if I think of home but can't return,

245
00:15:10,519 --> 00:15:11,559
it'd be too unbearable.

246
00:15:13,799 --> 00:15:14,600
Wei Tian,

247
00:15:15,759 --> 00:15:17,600
where's your hometown?

248
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:18,559
What brought you

249
00:15:18,559 --> 00:15:20,240
to Antilocaris?

250
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,159
I remember

251
00:15:35,159 --> 00:15:36,919
sometimes when I chatted with Rossi,

252
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,960
she really wanted to get her past memories back.

253
00:15:40,639 --> 00:15:41,840
But I joked with her,

254
00:15:42,519 --> 00:15:45,480
saying that sometimes,

255
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,440
not remembering isn't the worst part;

256
00:15:49,279 --> 00:15:52,120
it's being unable to forget when you want to.

257
00:15:58,559 --> 00:15:59,360
To be honest,

258
00:16:00,679 --> 00:16:03,840
sometimes I'd like to be like Rossi

259
00:16:04,559 --> 00:16:05,480
and experience

260
00:16:05,559 --> 00:16:07,720
what losing half your memories

261
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,320
actually feels like.

262
00:16:13,279 --> 00:16:14,200
To tell you the truth,

263
00:16:15,759 --> 00:16:16,600
I'd really like to

264
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:19,320
take the first half of my memories

265
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,480
from when I first arrived in Antilocaris

266
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,000
and just erase them.

267
00:16:26,159 --> 00:16:26,960
Wei Tian,

268
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:29,080
everyone's experiences

269
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,360
are different.

270
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:33,559
I don't know if this is right,

271
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:38,399
but even if they are bad memories,

272
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,000
I still believe that

273
00:16:40,279 --> 00:16:42,440
every moment is worth remembering.

274
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,359
What's going on?

275
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:10,000
Don't tell me we're out of gas.

276
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,799
At least the scenery here is nice.

277
00:17:15,559 --> 00:17:18,359
And you're a bit nicer than you look, too.

278
00:17:20,039 --> 00:17:21,000
Something's wrong with the car.

279
00:17:21,359 --> 00:17:22,440
The fuel consumption doesn't make sense.

280
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,359
Seriously?

281
00:17:25,039 --> 00:17:26,359
Don't tell me there's nothing you can do.

282
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:30,480
Can you handle this or not?

283
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,400
Wait, what's going on?

284
00:17:44,599 --> 00:17:45,519
There's no signal.

285
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,519
Do you have any?

286
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,519
Neither do I.

287
00:17:51,599 --> 00:17:52,359
What do we do now?

288
00:18:02,759 --> 00:18:04,200
The view here is really nice.

289
00:18:05,119 --> 00:18:05,839
I think I'm starting

290
00:18:05,839 --> 00:18:07,400
to like this feeling.

291
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:14,200
President Dan is probably heading back to the hotel.

292
00:18:14,279 --> 00:18:15,400
Let's hurry back.

293
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,200
We have time. Get in.

294
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,039
There's really no one around here.

295
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:42,480
My phone has no signal either.

296
00:18:42,759 --> 00:18:43,759
What do we do now?

297
00:18:44,759 --> 00:18:46,519
We won't really have to sleep on the streets, will we?

298
00:18:52,839 --> 00:18:54,319
Stand behind me. It's safer.

299
00:18:54,359 --> 00:18:55,160
Okay.

300
00:19:04,119 --> 00:19:05,200
Our car ran out of gas.

301
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,519
Could you spare us some fuel?

302
00:19:07,119 --> 00:19:07,519
Sure.

303
00:19:08,039 --> 00:19:08,559
Thank you.

304
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:11,799
All done.

305
00:19:12,079 --> 00:19:14,400
President Dan, for your safety,

306
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:15,640
I'm taking you back now.

307
00:19:16,319 --> 00:19:18,640
Come on, let's look around a bit more.

308
00:19:19,519 --> 00:19:21,319
Besides, I'm safe with you.

309
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,559
Manager An, you're back.

310
00:19:45,319 --> 00:19:47,880
Um, has President Dan returned?

311
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:49,240
President Dan? Haven't seen her.

312
00:19:52,039 --> 00:19:53,000
Isn't that her right over there?

313
00:20:33,119 --> 00:20:34,680
There are quite a few customers waiting right now.

314
00:20:35,039 --> 00:20:36,599
When will a table for three open up?

315
00:20:39,839 --> 00:20:42,079
Excuse me, do you have a reservation?

316
00:20:42,079 --> 00:20:42,799
This is my turf.

317
00:20:42,799 --> 00:20:44,039
I can do whatever I want.

318
00:20:44,359 --> 00:20:46,000
I'm sorry, but without a reservation,

319
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:47,200
you can't enter.

320
00:20:47,200 --> 00:20:48,119
Who do you think you are?

321
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:50,400
I'm one of the hotel managers.

322
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:51,839
And I'm also quite certain

323
00:20:52,039 --> 00:20:53,640
you are a guest at this hotel...

324
00:20:54,599 --> 00:20:55,559
...one of many.

325
00:20:58,039 --> 00:20:58,839
Um...

326
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:02,039
Madame Tina, long time no see!

327
00:21:02,039 --> 00:21:03,039
Allow me to introduce—

328
00:21:03,039 --> 00:21:04,720
This is President Dan from headquarters.

329
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:07,440
Anda, this person has no manners.

330
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:08,400
Fire her.

331
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:09,240
You—

332
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:11,599
Please, calm down.

333
00:21:11,599 --> 00:21:13,200
I'll take care of it right away.

334
00:21:14,839 --> 00:21:16,200
Look, that woman...

335
00:21:16,359 --> 00:21:17,799
is the second wife of Kwame,

336
00:21:17,799 --> 00:21:19,200
the boss of Bito Security.

337
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:19,880
We can't afford to offend her.

338
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:20,880
If we cross her,

339
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:22,440
our hotel is finished.

340
00:21:25,119 --> 00:21:25,599
Fine.

341
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:27,440
Wait, don't!

342
00:21:28,319 --> 00:21:28,960
Don't do that!

343
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:32,440
I'm sorry.

344
00:21:32,599 --> 00:21:33,279
I didn't know

345
00:21:33,279 --> 00:21:34,799
you were a VIP guest here.

346
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:35,960
I apologize to you.

347
00:21:38,319 --> 00:21:39,079
I've lost my appetite!

348
00:21:43,519 --> 00:21:44,480
What was that about?

349
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:46,720
Didn't I already apologize to her?

350
00:21:46,759 --> 00:21:48,119
Why did she throw something at me?

351
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:50,000
Do you know

352
00:21:50,359 --> 00:21:52,160
what that gesture she made meant?

353
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:56,119
It's like a declaration of war.

354
00:21:56,119 --> 00:21:57,880
It's a fight to the death.

355
00:21:58,799 --> 00:22:01,400
You... you mean

356
00:22:01,839 --> 00:22:04,279
she declared war on me?

357
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,000
Around here,

358
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:09,680
the "OK" gesture means a curse,

359
00:22:10,039 --> 00:22:13,400
and using your left hand is an insult.

360
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,480
You can't be serious.

361
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:17,200
I had no idea about any of that.

362
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:20,720
Is this...

363
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:23,599
is it really that serious?

364
00:22:24,039 --> 00:22:25,079
Anda is right.

365
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:29,160
Then... what should I do?

366
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:32,079
I advise you to stay put

367
00:22:32,079 --> 00:22:32,960
in your room

368
00:22:33,119 --> 00:22:33,839
and don't go anywhere.

369
00:22:40,519 --> 00:22:41,839
I'm definitely going to teach Plato Hotel

370
00:22:41,839 --> 00:22:42,799
a lesson.

371
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:45,920
The security at Plato Hotel

372
00:22:46,359 --> 00:22:47,359
is handled by

373
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,240
a friend of mine.

374
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:52,920
So do me a favor, will you?

375
00:22:53,759 --> 00:22:56,640
Wei Tian, we've known each other a long time.

376
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:58,039
You know what I'm like.

377
00:22:59,160 --> 00:22:59,759
Let me ask you this first:

378
00:23:02,079 --> 00:23:05,079
Are any of the people in the hotel your clients?

379
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:10,519
Then I really don't understand.

380
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:13,920
Someone I need to protect is inside.

381
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:18,000
Since when did the Silent Protectors

382
00:23:18,039 --> 00:23:19,160
start doing volunteer work?

383
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,400
I like peace.

384
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:24,039
Peace?

385
00:23:29,279 --> 00:23:31,359
Is there any peace in Antilocaris?

386
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:33,200
Still, I believe there is.

387
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:34,039
Fine.

388
00:23:35,079 --> 00:23:36,240
I'll listen to you this time.

389
00:23:37,119 --> 00:23:38,799
I won't hurt anyone in the hotel.

390
00:23:41,799 --> 00:23:43,200
But there won't be a next time.

391
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:43,759
I know.

392
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:46,720
Thank you.

393
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:50,559
Yesterday,

394
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:53,200
while filming footage, two war correspondents

395
00:23:53,200 --> 00:23:54,599
provoked a local gang

396
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:55,640
and were abducted.

397
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:58,440
The thugs subsequently

398
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:59,920
brutally beheaded both journalists.

399
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:01,319
Their heinous crimes

400
00:24:01,359 --> 00:24:03,720
have sparked widespread outrage across society.

401
00:24:03,839 --> 00:24:05,319
The government advises international tourists

402
00:24:05,359 --> 00:24:07,279
to exercise caution when traveling.

403
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:13,160
Xiang Lai, starting today,

404
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:15,359
you must stay by my side at all times.

405
00:24:15,799 --> 00:24:16,920
Wherever I go,

406
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:17,799
you follow.

407
00:24:18,359 --> 00:24:19,640
We eat together,

408
00:24:19,759 --> 00:24:20,720
and at night,

409
00:24:21,480 --> 00:24:22,480
you sleep on the couch.

410
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:28,160
President Dan, to fulfill your request,

411
00:24:28,319 --> 00:24:29,720
upgrading your security level

412
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:31,279
requires headquarters' approval.

413
00:24:32,519 --> 00:24:33,599
You saw the news, right?

414
00:24:34,039 --> 00:24:35,440
I'm in grave danger right now.

415
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:36,839
You can't leave my side.

416
00:24:38,759 --> 00:24:39,960
This requires headquarters' approval.

417
00:24:42,599 --> 00:24:44,920
Fine. You won't move in, right?

418
00:24:45,599 --> 00:24:47,599
Then I'll move into Zhong'an.

419
00:24:47,839 --> 00:24:49,000
That wouldn't be appropriate.

420
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:50,240
Exactly.

421
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:53,039
So you'll just have to move in with me.

422
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:11,519
Hello, sir. Here's your meal.

423
00:25:17,599 --> 00:25:18,559
I haven't seen you around before.

424
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:20,720
I'm new here.

425
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:22,680
Thanks.

426
00:25:25,119 --> 00:25:25,960
Please close the door for me.

427
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:26,559
Sure.

428
00:25:49,880 --> 00:25:50,680
Tell me,

429
00:25:51,599 --> 00:25:54,039
that woman didn't poison my food, did she?

430
00:25:54,680 --> 00:25:55,480
Probably not.

431
00:25:57,839 --> 00:25:59,000
Take a bite for me first.

432
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:04,160
Well?

433
00:26:05,519 --> 00:26:06,559
Are you poisoned?

434
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:09,119
I'm fine.

435
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,319
That won't do.

436
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:13,559
No, no. I'm still not reassured.

437
00:26:14,039 --> 00:26:14,799
Have another one.

438
00:26:16,759 --> 00:26:17,680
Eat it yourself.

439
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:21,440
You're no fun.

440
00:26:58,960 --> 00:27:00,079
I wasn't going to ask you,

441
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,799
but to avoid further conflicts between us...

442
00:27:06,559 --> 00:27:07,880
Why did you let that man go?

443
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,160
He's just a nobody.

444
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:14,440
Right now,

445
00:27:15,640 --> 00:27:18,160
you're in charge of Plato Hotel's security,

446
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:22,359
while Zhong'an Group is a Chinese company.

447
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:25,200
Its roots aren't very deep in Africa yet.

448
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:29,079
If something happens, who can help you?

449
00:27:30,119 --> 00:27:31,720
Only Bito, right?

450
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:35,720
Go talk to them.

451
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:42,880
Why are you telling me this?

452
00:27:45,279 --> 00:27:48,480
Didn't you just say I let him go?

453
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:52,240
Consider it an apology.

454
00:27:58,319 --> 00:27:59,240
Let's spar.

455
00:28:06,759 --> 00:28:08,880
I just don't want bad blood between Zhong'an and Bito.

456
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:11,720
Only cooperation brings peace.

457
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:44,319
Xiang Lai, where are you?

458
00:28:44,359 --> 00:28:45,440
I'm in the hotel lobby.

459
00:28:45,440 --> 00:28:46,480
What's up? Need something?

460
00:28:47,559 --> 00:28:49,559
Could you go out and pick up some local souvenirs for me?

461
00:28:49,599 --> 00:28:50,839
I'm heading back home soon,

462
00:28:50,839 --> 00:28:52,039
and you guys still won't let me go out.

463
00:28:54,240 --> 00:28:54,680
All right.

464
00:29:42,599 --> 00:29:43,160
Hello.

465
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:45,680
It's very fresh.

466
00:29:52,039 --> 00:29:52,880
Come take a look.

467
00:29:54,519 --> 00:29:55,400
Is this fresh?

468
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:57,759
Very fresh. Want some bananas?

469
00:29:59,079 --> 00:29:59,880
Thanks, thank you.

470
00:29:59,880 --> 00:30:02,200
I... I don't want any bananas.

471
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:04,559
I'll buy some next time.

472
00:30:04,599 --> 00:30:06,279
No, really. Thanks, though.

473
00:30:11,799 --> 00:30:12,480
Keep following them.

474
00:30:12,839 --> 00:30:13,279
Okay.

475
00:30:23,839 --> 00:30:25,599
No, I'm going back home in a few days.

476
00:30:25,599 --> 00:30:26,720
Didn't you ask me to buy it?

477
00:30:26,720 --> 00:30:28,839
You can't get it here.

478
00:30:32,079 --> 00:30:33,640
How about I get it for you at the airport?

479
00:30:36,359 --> 00:30:36,920
Please have a seat.

480
00:30:49,799 --> 00:30:50,839
Long time no see.

481
00:30:51,480 --> 00:30:52,359
Good to see you.

482
00:30:52,920 --> 00:30:55,400
You don't look so good.

483
00:30:58,640 --> 00:31:00,160
I sparred with Wei Tian this morning.

484
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:02,000
Doesn't look like it.

485
00:31:02,359 --> 00:31:04,680
Would Wei Tian spare your face?

486
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:07,240
You Silent Protectors sure have

487
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,119
a clear division of labor.

488
00:31:08,839 --> 00:31:10,279
One spars with me,

489
00:31:10,880 --> 00:31:12,240
and the other teases me.

490
00:31:14,279 --> 00:31:16,039
Someone from a professional firm like yours

491
00:31:16,279 --> 00:31:17,559
is skipping work too, aren't they?

492
00:31:18,240 --> 00:31:19,440
How do you know I'm skipping work?

493
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:24,359
Look.

494
00:31:27,039 --> 00:31:28,000
With this,

495
00:31:28,319 --> 00:31:30,279
the protectee's exact location

496
00:31:30,279 --> 00:31:31,240
shows up right here.

497
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:40,240
Is your client looking for you?

498
00:31:40,839 --> 00:31:41,480
Looking for me?

499
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:44,640
She's supposed to be at the Plato.

500
00:31:51,759 --> 00:31:52,279
Oh no.

501
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:39,519
Anda.

502
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:41,400
President Dan is missing.

503
00:32:41,920 --> 00:32:43,400
Isn't she in her room?

504
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:43,920
No.

505
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:45,799
I just checked her room, and nobody was there.

506
00:32:45,839 --> 00:32:47,440
And she won't answer her phone.

507
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:49,839
Where could she go? She's flying home tomorrow.

508
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:53,519
The shopping street.

509
00:32:55,519 --> 00:32:56,799
Stay here and wait for my word.

510
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,720
President Dan should be around here.

511
00:33:15,400 --> 00:33:16,359
Anda, go ahead.

512
00:33:17,279 --> 00:33:17,839
Wei Tian.

513
00:33:18,279 --> 00:33:20,880
Dan Feng snuck out.

514
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:22,000
We can't find her either.

515
00:33:22,119 --> 00:33:24,640
And Xiang Lai isn't answering my calls.

516
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:25,680
You mean Dan Feng...

517
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:28,599
...the one who provoked Kwame?

518
00:33:28,599 --> 00:33:30,240
Right, right, that's her.

519
00:33:30,839 --> 00:33:31,400
Where are you?

520
00:33:33,119 --> 00:33:34,599
At the shopping street.

521
00:33:34,799 --> 00:33:35,880
Wait for me. I'll be right there.

522
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:36,400
Okay.

523
00:34:52,159 --> 00:34:52,960
Excuse me, have you seen her?

524
00:34:53,280 --> 00:34:54,079
No, I haven't.

525
00:34:54,079 --> 00:34:55,239
Not at all? Are you sure?

526
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:56,159
Yes, I'm sure.

527
00:34:56,159 --> 00:34:56,840
Thank you.

528
00:35:00,239 --> 00:35:01,360
Excuse me, have you seen her?

529
00:35:02,559 --> 00:35:03,519
Have you seen a girl...

530
00:35:03,519 --> 00:35:05,159
...with hair about this long?

531
00:35:05,199 --> 00:35:06,000
Wearing a suit.

532
00:35:07,079 --> 00:35:09,039
She looked something like this.

533
00:35:09,039 --> 00:35:10,159
Sorry, we haven't.

534
00:35:10,760 --> 00:35:11,760
All right, thank you.

535
00:35:13,960 --> 00:35:14,760
President Dan.

536
00:35:16,159 --> 00:35:16,800
Sorry to bother you.

537
00:35:20,280 --> 00:35:22,320
It's unusual for Dan Feng to disappear like this.

538
00:35:23,039 --> 00:35:24,280
Did you check with Xiang Lai?

539
00:35:24,599 --> 00:35:26,639
I tried calling both of them, but neither answered.

540
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:38,079
Xiang Lai.

541
00:35:38,599 --> 00:35:39,360
What are you doing here?

542
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:40,400
Dan Feng is missing.

543
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:42,440
What kind of bodyguard are you?

544
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:44,159
Didn't you say you wouldn't leave her side?

545
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:46,239
She tricked me into going out for souvenirs.

546
00:35:47,039 --> 00:35:48,039
Dan Feng isn't missing.

547
00:35:48,119 --> 00:35:48,920
Look.

548
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:51,599
This tracker shows her location.

549
00:35:51,800 --> 00:35:53,000
The signal's just weak right now,

550
00:35:53,039 --> 00:35:54,000
so I lost her.

551
00:35:58,239 --> 00:35:59,360
Got a signal again.

552
00:36:01,679 --> 00:36:02,480
She's right over here. Let's go.

553
00:36:02,480 --> 00:36:02,719
Okay.

554
00:36:16,239 --> 00:36:17,039
Watch out, President Dan!

555
00:36:48,159 --> 00:36:48,840
Where's Dan Feng?

556
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:54,039
Let go of me!

557
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:55,800
Move it!

558
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:57,320
Hurry up!

559
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:02,719
Anda, what are you doing?

560
00:37:05,079 --> 00:37:07,519
I want to call the police, but I'm afraid they'll kill the hostage.

561
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:09,800
From what I know,

562
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:12,199
the local police are a mixed bag.

563
00:37:12,239 --> 00:37:14,119
Collusion with criminals is common.

564
00:37:14,840 --> 00:37:17,000
So don't blame yourself too much.

565
00:37:17,039 --> 00:37:18,400
We'll find a way out.

566
00:37:19,199 --> 00:37:20,559
So based on what you're saying,

567
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:21,960
there's no saving President Dan?

568
00:37:23,280 --> 00:37:24,320
That's not what I mean.

569
00:37:24,639 --> 00:37:25,800
Kidnapping President Dan...

570
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:27,239
I'm sure they have a motive.

571
00:37:29,440 --> 00:37:30,519
Then what should we do?

572
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:34,039
Wait.

573
00:37:35,079 --> 00:37:35,639
Wait?

574
00:37:35,920 --> 00:37:36,559
Right.

575
00:37:37,639 --> 00:37:39,559
Wait for their move, and we'll respond.

576
00:37:39,760 --> 00:37:41,119
Whatever they ask for,

577
00:37:41,119 --> 00:37:42,880
we'll meet their demands as best we can.

578
00:37:43,960 --> 00:37:45,400
What if they kill the hostage?

579
00:37:45,400 --> 00:37:46,159
They won't.

580
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:48,079
When they abducted her,

581
00:37:48,079 --> 00:37:48,639
they didn't kill anyone.

582
00:37:48,639 --> 00:37:49,719
They won't kill the hostage easily.

583
00:37:50,199 --> 00:37:52,159
Whether they want money or her life, they'll make their terms clear.

584
00:37:56,679 --> 00:37:57,960
Where are you taking me?

585
00:37:58,239 --> 00:38:00,079
Let me go! Let me go!

586
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:02,639
Where is this?

587
00:38:03,480 --> 00:38:05,840
Let go of me! Let go!

588
00:38:06,280 --> 00:38:08,079
Let me go!

589
00:38:10,119 --> 00:38:11,000
Let go of me!

590
00:38:12,559 --> 00:38:13,679
You're too loud.

591
00:38:14,119 --> 00:38:14,880
What are you doing?

592
00:38:15,159 --> 00:38:17,159
I'm Chinese! You can't kill me!

593
00:38:17,159 --> 00:38:18,599
This is my turf.

594
00:38:18,760 --> 00:38:20,119
My word is the law here.

595
00:38:20,639 --> 00:38:21,519
What do you want?

596
00:38:21,519 --> 00:38:21,960
Don't move!

597
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:23,880
What are you doing?

598
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:31,599
Mr. Xiang.

599
00:38:32,400 --> 00:38:33,440
This is Bito's warehouse,

600
00:38:33,440 --> 00:38:34,599
and their base of operations.

601
00:38:34,599 --> 00:38:36,280
If Dan Feng was abducted by them,

602
00:38:36,280 --> 00:38:37,480
he should be right here.

603
00:38:39,039 --> 00:38:40,079
We can't confirm yet

604
00:38:40,079 --> 00:38:41,559
that Bito did this.

605
00:38:42,239 --> 00:38:43,159
Besides, the kidnappers

606
00:38:43,159 --> 00:38:44,480
don't look like Kwame's men.

607
00:38:45,719 --> 00:38:47,679
We have too little intel on them,

608
00:38:47,679 --> 00:38:48,840
so we can't make contact.

609
00:38:50,039 --> 00:38:50,480
Here's the plan.

610
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:53,079
Take your team to search this area first.

611
00:38:53,119 --> 00:38:53,880
Check every corner.

612
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:54,360
Got it.

613
00:38:58,159 --> 00:39:01,400
An executive from the Plato Hotel has gone missing.

614
00:39:02,199 --> 00:39:04,559
We've been looking for him.

615
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:10,599
This has nothing to do with me.

616
00:39:21,079 --> 00:39:21,679
You don't believe me.

617
00:39:28,360 --> 00:39:30,280
I believe you. Thank you.

618
00:39:42,920 --> 00:39:43,400
Anda.

619
00:39:43,719 --> 00:39:45,679
Bito isn't behind what happened to Dan Feng.

620
00:39:46,599 --> 00:39:47,480
How do you know?

621
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:50,280
I just went to Bito and met Kwame.

622
00:39:50,440 --> 00:39:52,039
He told me himself he didn't do it.

623
00:39:52,679 --> 00:39:53,519
I believe him.

624
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:55,360
Then who could it be?

625
00:39:56,119 --> 00:39:56,920
Don't worry.

626
00:39:57,000 --> 00:39:57,960
I'm still investigating.

627
00:39:58,599 --> 00:39:59,400
Talk to you later.

628
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:03,000
Anda, is this President Dan's phone?

629
00:40:05,159 --> 00:40:06,400
It really is President Dan's.

630
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:08,639
Someone just left it at the front desk.

631
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:09,440
Who?

632
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,039
A little boy left it.

633
00:40:11,039 --> 00:40:12,840
He said someone told him to bring it to the desk.

634
00:40:17,519 --> 00:40:19,199
Anda, come save me!

635
00:40:19,599 --> 00:40:21,119
President Dan, where are you?

636
00:40:21,119 --> 00:40:22,079
Tell me!

637
00:40:22,480 --> 00:40:23,800
Prepare 100,000 dollars.

638
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:24,320
Anda, save me!

639
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:26,719
I'll let you know the time and location next.

640
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:29,480
No police, or I'll kill the hostage.

641
00:40:34,440 --> 00:40:35,239
What did they say?

642
00:40:35,920 --> 00:40:38,840
They want... they want 100,000 dollars.

643
00:40:39,079 --> 00:40:41,119
No police, or they'll kill the hostage.

644
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:45,480
How is it? Did you find her?

645
00:40:46,199 --> 00:40:47,199
It's confirmed now.

646
00:40:47,639 --> 00:40:48,800
Kwame didn't do it.

647
00:40:49,559 --> 00:40:51,280
This Plato Hotel...

648
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:53,559
Just how many people did it offend?

649
00:40:55,199 --> 00:40:57,199
Anda wanted to clean up this mess,

650
00:40:57,239 --> 00:40:59,079
never expecting it to get even messier.

651
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:01,079
She's the one who caused all the trouble.

652
00:41:01,559 --> 00:41:03,360
She should be the one getting grabbed today.

653
00:41:04,800 --> 00:41:05,320
Rossi,

654
00:41:07,239 --> 00:41:08,559
go find Grace.

655
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,480
You suspect...

656
00:41:12,559 --> 00:41:13,880
there's another motive behind the kidnapping?

657
00:41:14,440 --> 00:41:15,239
Okay.

658
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:18,800
Sha Lan,

659
00:41:19,760 --> 00:41:20,760
let's head to Plato Hotel.

660
00:41:21,320 --> 00:41:22,119
Bring your laptop.

661
00:41:25,880 --> 00:41:28,199
When President Dan called just now,

662
00:41:28,199 --> 00:41:29,639
she kept crying, begging me to save her.

663
00:41:29,639 --> 00:41:32,239
I really don't know what to do.

664
00:41:32,639 --> 00:41:34,280
Even though I don't like her,

665
00:41:35,079 --> 00:41:37,199
I never expected things would turn out like this.

666
00:41:37,559 --> 00:41:39,360
I don't even know what I can do.

667
00:41:44,199 --> 00:41:45,400
Has anyone contacted you?

668
00:41:46,880 --> 00:41:49,480
They just called demanding 100,000 dollars.

669
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:52,760
Hand the phone to Xiang Lai.

670
00:41:59,719 --> 00:42:01,000
Xiang Lai, listen to me.

671
00:42:01,639 --> 00:42:02,920
In Antilocaris,

672
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:05,119
Zhong'an cannot use lethal weapons.

673
00:42:05,559 --> 00:42:07,000
If anything goes wrong,

674
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:08,199
it'll be bad.

675
00:42:08,840 --> 00:42:10,920
Never put Zhong'an in the spotlight.

676
00:42:11,559 --> 00:42:13,760
Alright, I get what you mean.

677
00:42:14,039 --> 00:42:14,960
I'll think about it.

678
00:42:15,559 --> 00:42:16,960
Okay, talk to you later.

679
00:42:22,599 --> 00:42:24,039
If it wasn't Kwame,

680
00:42:24,599 --> 00:42:25,679
then it's really strange.

681
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:28,400
She just arrived in Africa a few days ago.

682
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:30,280
She couldn't have crossed anyone.

683
00:42:32,239 --> 00:42:33,599
What should we do then?

684
00:42:33,639 --> 00:42:36,239
100,000 dollars isn't a small amount.

685
00:42:42,199 --> 00:42:43,280
That much money...

686
00:42:45,320 --> 00:42:46,480
is no trivial matter.

687
00:42:47,519 --> 00:42:50,719
Are you sure President Dan is in their hands?

688
00:42:50,719 --> 00:42:51,440
I'm sure.

689
00:42:52,159 --> 00:42:52,960
No.

690
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:54,719
I need to think.

691
00:42:54,960 --> 00:42:56,480
Shouldn't we report this to headquarters?

692
00:42:56,480 --> 00:42:57,199
Right, exactly.

693
00:42:57,360 --> 00:42:58,960
President Xiao, 100,000 dollars...

694
00:42:58,960 --> 00:43:00,239
that's not a small sum.

695
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:02,639
A life is at stake. We can't wait.

696
00:43:05,920 --> 00:43:07,880
Right, we can't wait.

697
00:43:08,079 --> 00:43:09,760
But we really can't report to headquarters.

698
00:43:09,800 --> 00:43:10,599
If we report this to headquarters,

699
00:43:10,599 --> 00:43:11,880
it'll turn into a huge deal.

700
00:43:12,079 --> 00:43:13,599
President Dan had an accident on our watch.

701
00:43:13,760 --> 00:43:15,239
We should resolve it ourselves.

702
00:43:15,719 --> 00:43:16,360
A person's life...

703
00:43:16,360 --> 00:43:18,280
compared to our jobs,

704
00:43:18,280 --> 00:43:19,400
is it really worth that little?

705
00:43:21,280 --> 00:43:22,519
I will handle this matter.

706
00:43:22,639 --> 00:43:23,880
Of course you have to handle it.

707
00:43:24,679 --> 00:43:26,320
As the hotel's head of security

708
00:43:27,039 --> 00:43:28,599
and President Dan's bodyguard,

709
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:30,239
now that President Dan is in danger,

710
00:43:30,280 --> 00:43:31,440
it's your dereliction of duty.

711
00:43:31,639 --> 00:43:33,679
And you must take full responsibility.
